name tikz-optics
category Package
revision 62977
shortdesc A library for drawing optical setups with TikZ
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a new TikZ library designed to easily
longdesc draw optical setups with TikZ. It provides shapes for lens,
longdesc mirror, etc. The geometrically (in)correct computation of light
longdesc rays through the setup is left to the user.
runfiles size=22
